8ac23fbb93f85.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745013308","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176190/21301111de870178a2cd2bfac328ac23fbb93f85/ss_21301111de870178a2cd2bfac328ac23fbb93f85.600x338.jpg?t=1745013308"}],"short_description":"Run a tea shop in the British countryside and enkindle your love for poetry in this short, heartfelt visual novel. You play as Ms. Meadows, an old chai enthusiast, as she prepares for her best friend\u2019s long-anticipated visit.","steam_appid":3176190,"support_info":{"email":"theboss@bluetangostreet.com","url":"www.bluetangostreet.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.bluetangostreet.com/"}